  "narrative": "<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Short impact summary</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Alles verandert altijd - Herziene editie (2024), published by Leuven University Press, has no recorded citations yet, but it has been downloaded 1,206 times.</p>\n<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Full narrative</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Alles verandert altijd - Herziene editie by Lieven D'hulst and Chris Van de Poel was published by Leuven University Press in 2024. Conceptually, the work connects to Humanities and Art.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">OpenAlex records no citations for the book so far.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">It has been downloaded 1,206 times via OAPEN. Its subject matter aligns with Quality Education among the Sustainable Development Goals. The work was funded by KU Leuven and ELV (Expertisecentrum Literair Vertalen).</p>",
