  "narrative_llm": "<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Short impact summary</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">This revised scholarly book shows clear signs of active use rather than citation-based impact: it has been downloaded 1,206 times, is available open access, and is aligned with Quality Education. Its record also shows support from KU Leuven and ELV (Expertisecentrum Literair Vertalen), underscoring its role as a practical, field-facing resource for literary translation.</p>\n<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Full narrative</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Alles verandert altijd - Herziene editie is a revised scholarly book in the humanities and arts that functions as a teaching and professional resource for literary translation into and out of Dutch. The strongest evidence of impact in the record is usage: the book has been downloaded 1,206 times, suggesting sustained interest and practical uptake. It is also openly accessible, which lowers barriers for students, educators, and practitioners seeking a current guide to literary translation.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">The book’s profile is especially consistent with educational and professional relevance. Its alignment with Quality Education indicates a strong fit with learning-oriented use, and the funding support recorded from KU Leuven and ELV points to institutional backing from organisations closely connected to translation expertise and higher education. Together, these signals suggest a work designed to support training, skill development, and knowledge transfer in a specialist field.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">The citation record is currently quiet, with no citations reported in OpenAlex. For a 2024 book, that should be read as an early-stage evidence base rather than as a conclusion about long-term influence. In this case, the available record is better interpreted through access and adoption signals: open availability, download activity, and the book’s explicit educational purpose.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Overall, the impact picture is one of immediate practical reach. The book appears to be circulating as a usable reference for literary translation education and professional practice, with the clearest measurable influence visible in downloads and open access rather than in scholarly citation accumulation so far.</p>",
